lay image from Kiro’s learn-by-playing guide.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/spirit-of-kiro.webp","alt","Spirit of Kiro workshop gameplay with a ghost beside the item lever and crafting workbench.","https://kiro.dev/docs/guides/learn-by-playing/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","Creator-attributed clients / models (not inferred from related tools)",[86],"Kiro","Creator evidence",[91],"evidence","section",{"_57":92,"_25":93,"_94":95},"Read the official Kiro development disclosure","https://github.com/kirodotdev/spirit-of-kiro#spirit-of-kiro","note","Official creator statement reports more than 95% prompted code. The core crafting loop is complete; roadmap features and intentionally unfinished challenge-branch tasks remain separate.","Source contents","complete project","Project source",[100],{"_57":101,"_25":102,"_94":103},"Open the complete crafting-game project","https://github.com/kirodotdev/spirit-of-kiro","MIT-0 game repository with Vue client, Bun server, item-image service, infrastructure, and deployment documentation. Runtime item text and interactions depend on AWS Bedrock; item-image generation has additional optional model requirements.","Access type","download","demo","Play or run",[109],{"_57":110,"_25":111,"_94":112},"Download and run Spirit of Kiro","https://github.com/kirodotdev/spirit-of-kiro/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","No anonymous hosted game is linked by the official project. Local play requires Docker/Podman, an AWS account/credentials and CLI, Bedrock access to supported text models, and deployed Cognito resources. Follow docs/local-setup.md to launch the stack and bootstrap DynamoDB. AWS runtime usage can incur charges; source-checked steps, not executed.","Game platform","Source download","Guide format","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[119],{"_57":120,"_25":75,"_94":-7},"Follow the official learn-by-playing guide","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[125,126,127,128],"Read the official setup guide and confirm the AWS model access required for the runtime.","Deploy the Cognito resources, start the client/server stack, and bootstrap the local DynamoDB tables.","Play the discover, craft, and sell loop before attempting the challenge branch.","Follow one guided bug fix or feature change and verify the resulting interaction in the game.","AI workflow / foundation context","The official Kiro project says more than 95% of its code was written by prompting Kiro. Its guide uses the actual game to teach steering, bug fixes, refactoring, specifications, hooks, and MCP; AI also generates items and crafting outcomes at runtime.","aiUse","guidance","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribution)","category","provenance","Track","2D","track","metadata","Engine","Custom Vue 3 · DOM/CSS sprites · TypeScript","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[125,126,127,128],{"_57":120,"_25":75,"_17":116},{"_57":110,"_25":111,"_17":105,"_94":112},{"_57":101,"_25":102,"_154":155,"_94":103},{"_57":92,"_25":93,"_94":95},"resourceIds",[],"scope","complete-project",{"_157":158},"documents",{"_159":160,"_161":162},"en",[164,168,169,170,167,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,166,203,165,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221],"zh",[163,164,165,166,167],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-